~ start
if knows("met")
	Bouncer: You again. That's {{recall("times_talked", 0)}} times now.
else
	Bouncer: Oi. You're not on the list.
- I'm on every list.
	Bouncer: Cheeky. Last warning.
	do remember("cheeky")
	- Fine, I'm going.
		Bouncer: Smart choice.
	- Make me.
		Bouncer: Your funeral.
		do start_combat()
- Still not on it, then? [if knows("cheeky") /]
	Bouncer: Don't push it.
- Sorry, wrong door.
	Bouncer: Yeah. It is. The club's round the back.
	do SaveManager.set_flag("found_club")
=> END
